    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n*   Ask the bot to describe a simple scene, like 'a quiet forest path.'\r\n*   Try prompting the bot to describe the same scene, but add sensory details to your prompt, like 'a forest path with the smell of damp earth and rustling leaves.'\r\n*   Ask the bot to describe a scenario using specific emotions, such as 'describe a cozy living room on a cold winter night, evoking warmth and comfort.'\r\n*   Experiment with asking the bot to use figurative language, like 'describe a bustling city street using metaphors and similes.'\r\n*   Work with the bot to revise one of its descriptions to make it even more vivid and engaging, focusing on adding more sensory details or stronger verbs.",
